### Giá trị cá nhân/test: điền cục bộ, không commit thông tin thật
@customerName = Test Customer
@customerPhone =
@customerEmail =
@customerPassword =
@customerOtp =
@adminPhone =
@adminPassword =
@adminOtp =
@wrongAdminOtp = not-a-code

### 1. Lấy CSRF token; REST Client cần giữ cookie session
# @name csrf
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### 2. Chưa đăng nhập vào Admin me - 401
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/me

### 3. Bắt đầu đăng ký Customer
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/register/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "ho_ten": "{{customerName}}",
  "so_dien_thoai": "{{customerPhone}}",
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "mat_khau": "{{customerPassword}}",
  "nhap_lai_mat_khau": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

### 4. Gửi lại OTP đăng ký (chỉ chạy sau khi cooldown 60 giây; dùng OTP mới nhất)
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/otp/resend
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}"
}

### 5. Xác nhận đăng ký; thành công trả 201 và đăng nhập Customer
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/register/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "email": "{{customerEmail}}",
  "otp": "{{customerOtp}}"
}

### 6. Xem Customer hiện tại - 200
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/me

### Customer không được vào Admin - 403
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/me

### 7. Logout Customer - 200
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

###
# @name csrfAfterCustomerLogout
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### Sau logout, Customer me - 401
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/me

### Logout lần hai vẫn thành công - 200
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfAfterCustomerLogout.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

###
# @name csrfForCustomerLogin
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### 8. Đăng nhập Customer - dùng tài khoản đã đăng ký ở trên
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForCustomerLogin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "so_dien_thoai": "{{customerPhone}}",
  "mat_khau": "{{customerPassword}}"
}

### 9. Logout Customer trước khi thử Admin
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForCustomerLogin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

###
# @name csrfForAdmin
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### 10. Admin đăng nhập bước 1; OTP gửi tới email lấy từ CSDL
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "so_dien_thoai": "{{adminPhone}}",
  "mat_khau": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Pending OTP chưa phải đăng nhập - Admin me và Customer me đều 401
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/me

###
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/me

### Resend ngay trong cooldown 60 giây - 429
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/otp/resend
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{}

### OTP sai - 422, response có remaining_attempts
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "otp": "{{wrongAdminOtp}}"
}

### OTP đúng - 200, nhập mã mới nhất từ email/outbox
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "otp": "{{adminOtp}}"
}

### 11. Admin đã xác thực OTP - 200
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/me

### Dùng lại OTP sau khi pending bị xóa - 401
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{
  "otp": "{{adminOtp}}"
}

### 12. Logout Admin - 200
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfForAdmin.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

###
# @name csrfAfterAdminLogout
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/csrf

### Sau logout, Admin me - 401
GET http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/me

### Resend khi không có pending - 401
POST http://localhost/monsmokee/backend/public/api/admin/auth/otp/resend
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfAfterAdminLogout.response.body.data.csrf_token}}

{}
